 "defect": {
  "defect_type": "missing",
  "message": "The description specifies laminated elastomeric bearings only by their rubber layer thickness and count (\"plain laminated elastomeric bearings, one under each girder end; four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick\") but gives no bearing plan dimensions (length a and width b). The governing rules JTG3362-8.7-S, JTG3362-8.7-Kv and JTG3362-8.7-Kh require a and b to compute the shape factor S = a*b/(2*t1*(a+b)) and hence the vertical and shear stiffnesses (Kv, Kh); the instance schema correspondingly expects a_mm and b_mm, and the knowledge graph supplies no default or standard bearing plan size. Without a and b the support spring stiffnesses cannot be determined, so the model cannot be built as given."
 },
